//! On-chain verification tests driven by our REAL snarkjs Groth16 proofs.
//!
//! Fixtures in `test_fixtures.rs` are generated by
//! `contracts/scripts/convert.js` from `build/proofs/*.json` and are the exact
//! bytes submitted on testnet.

